  "question": {
    "text": "Suppose Anil&#39;s mother wants to give <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;whole fruits to Anil from a basket of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math> red apples, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math> white apples and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math> oranges. If in the selected <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math> fruits, at least <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> orange, at least one red apple and at least one white apple must be given, then the number of ways, Anil&#39;s mother can offer <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math> fruits to Anil is _____ .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "6860",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math> Red apple<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math> white apple<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math> oranges <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, for offering&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math> fruits to be selected&nbsp;</p><p>Possible selections :- <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mi>R</mi><mi>A</mi></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>WA</mi><mo>)</mo></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>RA</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>WA</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, &nbsp;or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>RA</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>WA</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Required number of ways</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>8</mn></mmultiscripts><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>7</mn></mmultiscripts><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>5</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>8</mn></mmultiscripts><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>7</mn></mmultiscripts><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>5</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>8</mn></mmultiscripts><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>7</mn></mmultiscripts><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>5</mn></mmultiscripts></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1960</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2940</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1960</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>6860</mn></math></p>",
